<h1>InnManager Privacy Policy</h1>

<p>InnManager values and respects the privacy of its users and hotel guests. This website is a demonstration of a hotel management system developed for educational purposes. The website displays fictional sample hotel information and does not require users to enter personal information. No real guest, employee, or payment information should be included in the sample data.</p>
